Fix a bug on backpack weight calculate. 
This is a problem with the original game version, not with mods, and I have successfully replicated it without mods. 

This is because during initialization, the system does not calculate the weight of items with 'preview' flag. 
However, when calculating weight changes afterwards, the official overlooked the 'preview' flag, resulting in virtual items also being counted for weight (including increase and decrease). 

In addition, due to some unknown reasons, Heavy Weapons can also be placed in backpacks instead of being properly discarded. 
They will occupy weight, and players cannot remove them. 
This patch will recheck items and drop Heavy Weapon items in the inventory after the archive is loaded. 

Finally, during you drop items and use items (such as pizza) before closing the inventory menu, the weight value displayed will change to the weight before drop the items. 
I also fixed this bug. 
